        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play, brutal to master. Move side to side to avoid disaster! <br><br>In this arcade-inspired experience, you play as The Block, the last block of their kind. With each evil block launching at high velocity to remove you forever, you must use persistence and resilience to survive as long as you can! <br><br>Survive for 30 seconds and you’re a true block legend. <br><br>Customise your block with a colour picker and secret unlockables. <br><br>No upgrades. No power-ups. Just bounce-or-die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play, brutal to master. Move side to side to avoid disaster! <br><br>In this arcade-inspired experience, you play as The Block, the last block of their kind. With each evil block launching at high velocity to remove you forever, you must use persistence and resilience to survive as long as you can! <br><br>Survive for 30 seconds and you’re a true block legend. <br><br>Customise your block with a colour picker and secret unlockables. <br><br>No upgrades. No power-ups. Just bounce-or-die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
